      "message": "This change is basically allowing `framework-connectivity-pre-jarjar-without-cronet` to be used for all cross-container dependencies. Blindly allowlisting this module for all reverse dependencies is a source of potential errors.\n\nAlso, note that the ongoing discussion is regarding `framework-connectivity-pre-jarjar`, not `framework-connectivity-pre-jarjar-without-cronet`. Even when b/382299968 is implemented it would not be able to replace `*-without-cronet` module as it contains cronet. The connectivity team would have to figure out how to statically include cronet in the apex and figure out how to use it for intra-apex communication purpose.",
